<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-01T09:33:00.941Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russian drone attacks continue, killing 13 people at a Ukrainian railway station and prompting further strikes on transport hubs. A localized cease-fire in the occupied city of Oleshky entered its third day, allowing evacuees to cross into Ukraine via Belarus and reunite with families, while attacks on aid vehicles persist. Russia’s shadow fleet is adapting drones with makeshift armor made from nets and rubber tires. Ukrainian clergy have suffered heavy losses, with 120 members reported killed. The conflict still accounts for 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/1/ukrainian-evacuees-from-russian-occupied-oleshky-reunite-with-family?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168702&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168712&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168682&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPcHMzMXk4dHkwMkpoWXI3NUg4ek44akMwX3BHcDRTOXpKcTNJN0htcnp3al9VV1VVLThKdlFya0NnMlNIdnpoMGtMVEVvMzA5RlBiTFNubjVZRmpUMlJNdDhETTBsOS0waEQwNkljYjFrV0Fiam84QkJIZG9XT3VQYVBjTnNnS2JIVng5OWhud1VUODdNREk0X01xeTZBWmZ2WmNJeDFKR0JiRkZJSG1CcExTSEFNTVY2UG5XWGsyNzkzc2xi?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQNmtxM1NKZjFSUWFCMC1QYmV1SUVPa28zbHMzV1RCWDVhaks5RDZfTWR6Y1FTQW5yMXpVenFUZF90eUhwdFZ6OVV0ek9JREtzSnktbTdoZGljNG81LW5fTXNJNDc3NXk1dlJVbkVDelh6cXBmZWNFRUY5RExmcVpETWJYbTU2WEJYUzRXdGwtSFVqd25tclp0TWEtLVVBMWNQMW1DbjBRUXNqcEJqbEVQdE1B?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr